erdict Reasoning\n- ✅ Fiction book (Christian Historical Fiction)\n- ✅ Released in 2026 (September 13, 2026, consistent with filters used)\n- ✅ 188 reviews (exceeds the 50-review minimum)\n- ✅ Highest-rated (4.9 stars, top of Avg. Customer Review sorted results)\n- ✅ Methodology was sound: department filter → publication date filter → sort by avg. customer review → verification via product page\n\n## Final Verdict: **SUCCESS**",
